00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,360
本:灯灭了.
Ben: The lights went off.

139
00:09:37,140 --> 00:09:40,900
克莉丝:谢谢你,科学先生.把灯打开吧.
Chrissy: Thank you Mr.Science.Now put them back on.

140
00:09:41,420 --> 00:09:43,180
本:克莉丝,我不能.我想停电了.
Ben: Chrissy I can't, I think the power is off.

141
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,760
克莉丝:我不喜欢黑暗.
Chrissy: I don't like the dark.

142
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:52,600
本:噢,这有些火柴.克莉丝,放开我的腿.
Ben: Oh, here's some matches.Chrissy get off my leg.

143
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,800
克莉丝:好的.
Chrissy: Ok.

144
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:08,280
本:噢!这下好多了.我去看看到底怎么回事.抓住.别那么紧!天啊,整个街区都黑了.
Ben: Aw!!Oh, that's lots better.I'm going to see if I can find out

145
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:11,160
what happened.Hold on.Not that tight!Man, the whole neighborhood is dark

146
00:10:19,980 --> 00:10:20,940
克莉丝:你干什么了?
Chrissy: What did you do?

147
00:10:22,060 --> 00:10:25,120
本:什么也没干!是停电,怎么能怪我呢?
Ben: Nothing!It's a power failure, why are you blaming me?

148
00:10:25,220 --> 00:10:27,680
克莉丝:妈妈爸爸在家时从没发生多这样的事.
Chrissy: This never happens when mommy or daddy are home.

149
00:10:32,140 --> 00:10:36,020
本:看,你就呆在这,
Ben: Look, you stay right here, I know where a flashlight is.

150
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:43,360
我知道哪有手电.妈妈总是把他放在…呃…圣诞装饰旁边.
Mom keeps it up here next to the uh....Christmas ornaments.

151
00:10:45,300 --> 00:10:47,180
太好了,还能用.
Great, it still works.

152
00:10:49,620 --> 00:10:52,460
克莉丝:那不是真灯.把真灯打开.
Chrissy: That's not a real light.Put the lamp back on.

153
00:10:52,460 --> 00:10:52,560
本:克莉丝,不行.没有电.
Ben: Chrissy, I can't there is no electricity.

154
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:58,380
克莉丝:噢,那我们就看电视等电来吧.
Chrissy: Oh, so let's watch television tell it comes back on.

155
00:11:00,140 --> 00:11:03,160
本:下次我再照顾你,爸爸就得给我买辆车.
Ben: Next time I baby-sit you, dad is buying me a car.

156
00:11:04,940 --> 00:11:07,700
太棒了,有收音机.现在也许我们可以知道发生什么事了.
Great, here is the radio.Now maybe we can find out what is going on.

157
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:11,500
克莉丝:等等,我不能看电视,但你却能听收音机?
Chrissy: Wait a minute, I can't watch T.V.but you can listen to the radio?

158
00:11:11,500 --> 00:11:19,400
本:克莉丝!我们来玩个叫"闭嘴"的游戏.你先来.
Ben: Chrissy!We are going to play a little game called "shut up".You go first.

159
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:26,000
收音机播音员:暴风刮落了很多电线,造成长岛大部分地区停电.
Radio announcer: The storm has downed a number of power lines causing blackouts over most of long island.

160
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:30,400
收音机播音员:当局预计停电可能还要持续八到十二个小时.
Radio announcer: Local predicts that the blackout will last another eight to twelve hours.

161
00:11:33,740 --> 00:11:33,800
迈克:一个小中断,好吧!德怀特,开门.
Mike: A blackout, great!Dwight, open the door.

162
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:37,000
德怀特:噢!
Dwight: Woops!

163
00:11:40,300 --> 00:11:42,440
迈克:我不想听这家伙说'噢'.
Mike: I don't want to hear woops from this guy.

164
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:45,600
德怀特:我刚刚想起门的电是和房子的主电线连在一起的.
Dwight: I just remembered that the door is electrically patched into the

165
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:48,620
我们无法期望这个时代的房子…
main circuitry of the house.No way can we date a house of this age....

166
00:11:48,700 --> 00:11:49,400
迈克:有话直说.
Mike: Cut to the chase.

167
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:49,500
德怀特:我们就向老鼠一样被困住了.
Dwight: We are trapped like rats.

168
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:55,020
迈克:好吧.凯特,注意点,我打破窗子了.
Mike: All right.Kate, watch you, I am going to break a window.

169
00:11:55,020 --> 00:11:55,120
凯特:迈克!
Kate: Mike!

170
00:11:55,420 --> 00:11:58,040
开萝尔:等等,等等!
Carol: Wait, wait, wait!There is an icy wind out there and the heat is off.

171
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:59,760
外面寒风刺骨,又没有暖气.你什么也别打破.
You are not breaking anything.

172
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:03,100
迈克:看,开萝尔.我要做的就是找点什么贴上字条说明我们的情况,再把他扔到街上去.
Mike: Look Carol, all I have to do is throw something down to the street with a note attached explaining our situation.

173
00:12:03,100 --> 00:12:10,200
那么,呃,我们能找到什么最不值钱的东西?
Now, uh, what's the most worthless thing we've got up here?

174
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:15,920
开萝尔:离我的德怀特远点.
Carol: You leave my Dwight alone.

175
00:12:16,260 --> 00:12:17,420
凯特:这开始变冷了.
Kate: It's getting cold.

176
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:20,400
德怀特:别以为我会被冻死.我一直以为那会是在洗澡的时候.
Dwight: Never thought I'd die by freezing.I always thought it would be a shower mishap.

177
00:12:20,400 --> 00:12:23,300
迈克:来吧,我们不会被冻着的.有很多方法可以保暖.比如,呃…
Mike: Come on, we are not going to freeze.There are plenty of ways to keep warm.Like, uh...

178
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:27,960
德怀特:我们可以吃东西.
Dwight: We could eat.

179
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:28,060
开萝尔/迈克/凯特:传递
Carol/Mike/Kate: Pass

180
00:12:30,420 --> 00:12:32,360
德怀特:我是说甜点.
Dwight: I was talking about dessert.

181
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,800
迈克:噢,别告诉我.是莫尔夫买给你的那只鹅做的鹅肉浆果馅饼吗?
Mike: Oh, don't tell me.Merve sold you a goose for a goose berry pie?

182
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:37,700
德怀特:不,是华夫甜饼.
Dwight: No, waffle sweet-cake.

183
00:12:37,700 --> 00:12:40,800
凯特:我快饿死了.你保证这里一点肉也没有?
Kate: I'm starved.Promise there is not a speck of meat in this?

184
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:47,080
德怀特:一点也没有.只用了猪头样的一瓶酒.
Dwight: None.Just a hogs heard of "wassa wine".

185
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:53,820
杰森:让让,傻瓜.
Jason: Move it goober.

186
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:55,040
麦琪:感觉好点了吗?
Maggie: Feel better?

187
00:12:56,060 --> 00:12:59,840
杰森:是的,直到我发现有辆警车在我们前面.
Jason: I did until I realized that is a police car in front of us.

188
00:13:03,500 --> 00:13:06,480
警察:请原谅,先生.你刚才是叫我傻瓜吗?
Police man: Excuse me sir, but did you just call me goober?

189
00:13:07,880 --> 00:13:11,800
杰森:我是说警官,警官.谢谢询问.晚安.
Jason: That was trooper, trooper.Thanks for asking.Good night.

190
00:13:12,620 --> 00:13:14,280
警察:前面有一些电线断了.岛上大部分地区已经停电.
Police man: We've got some downed power lines up ahead.

191
00:13:14,300 --> 00:13:15,400
请别着急.
Most of the island is blacked out.Keep your pants on.

192
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:17,400
麦琪:停电,杰森,孩子们!
Maggie: A black out, Jason the children!

193
00:13:17,400 --> 00:13:22,000
杰森:噢,放松点,亲爱的.克莉丝有保姆看着,其他人也不会有事.迈克可能正在利用它.
Jason: Oh relax sweetheart.Chrissy is with a sitter, the others are fine.Mike is probably taking advantage of it.

194
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:28,800
麦琪:噢,好极了!偏偏是今晚不在家.
Maggie: Oh great!Of all the nights to be taken away from home.

195
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:31,920
杰森:那是什么意思.为什么好像是我的错?
Jason: What's that suppose to mean.What like this is my fault?

196
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:35,220
麦琪,三个月前今晚只是日历上普通的一天.
Maggie, three months ago tonight was just a date on the calendar.

197
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:38,600
是我们共同把它圈起来作为共同享受生活的时间的.
We mutually circled it for some quality time together.

198
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:41,780
麦琪:噢,这就是你的想法?
Maggie: Oh, is that all this is to you?

199
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:44,060
杰森:问题是…
Jason: The point is...

200
00:13:44,060 --> 00:13:45,760
麦琪:这算什么,诊所里看病吗?
Maggie: What is this, some kind of clinical exercise?

201
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:47,980
好吧,杰森.你的日程表上还有什么?
Ok Jason, what else was on your agenda?

202
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:52,940
晚上8点说空洞的情话.9点恭维我的耳环.
Eight P.M.say empty romantic words.Nine P.M.compliment my earrings.Eleven P.

203
00:13:52,940 --> 00:13:55,000
11点吻我,然后等着好事?
M.kiss me and hope for the best?

204
00:13:57,160 --> 00:14:00,160
杰森:亲爱的,看,我很抱歉.
Jason: Sweetheart, look I'm sorry.I did want to be with you tonight.

205
00:14:00,300 --> 00:14:03,760
今晚我确实想跟你在一起.我想…等一下,你也不想出来的!!
I wanted to spend...wait a minute, you didn't want to be here either!!

206
00:14:04,060 --> 00:14:05,500
麦琪:不,杰森,我没有说我不想…
Maggie: No Jason, I didn't say I didn't want...

207
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:08,220
杰森:我绝对没有必要道歉,'
Jason: I have absolutely nothing to apologize for,

208
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:10,980
今晚不行我有最后期限的工作要做'小姐.
Miss not tonight dear I have a deadline.

209
00:14:12,460 --> 00:14:14,100
麦琪:好吧,如果你非要那么想.
Maggie: Well, if that's the way you feel about it.

210
00:14:14,540 --> 00:14:15,480
杰森:你要去哪?
Jason: Where are you going?

211
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:16,400
麦琪:我要走回家.至少那有人想和我说话.
Maggie: I am walking home.At least there people want to talk to me.

212
00:14:16,400 --> 00:14:27,000
杰森:啊!
Jason: Ah!

213
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:31,700
麦琪:外面寒风刺骨,我又穿着薄鞋.
Maggie: There is an icy wind and I am wearing thin shoes.

214
00:14:31,700 --> 00:14:36,500
开萝尔:迈克,开来礼貌小姐受不了她的蛋糕了.
Carol: Well Mike, guess Miss Manners couldn't hold her cake.

215
00:14:36,500 --> 00:14:39,300
迈克:德怀特,一只猪头里到底能装多少酒?
Mike: Dwight, exactly how much wine is in a hogs head?

216
00:14:39,300 --> 00:14:42,100
德怀特:63加仑左右.
Dwight: About sixty-three gallons.

217
00:14:42,100 --> 00:14:43,400
迈克:63加仑?
Mike: Sixty-three gallons?

218
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:48,440
德怀特:大部分都烧掉了.
Dwight: Most of it cooks off.

219
00:14:50,020 --> 00:14:53,640
迈克:我不信.你先是让我们陷入黑暗,然后给我们吃臭肉,又灌醉了凯特.
Mike: I don't believe this!First you get us trapped in the dark, then you

220
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:54,000
try to feed us road kill, you get my girl plastered

221
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:58,000
德怀特:嘿,在洛杉矶人们要为这种晚会花大价钱的.
Dwight: Hey, in LA people pay big buck for a party like that.

222
00:15:01,460 --> 00:15:04,600
迈克:是啊,可这里不是洛杉矶.我们越来越冷了.你打算怎么让我们摆脱麻烦,弯脚趾?
Mike: Yeah well this isn't LA.We are getting colder by the minute.How are you going to get us out of this mess curly, toes?

223
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:10,200
德怀特:啊,我们可以用帘子遮住说有墙和窗子,阻挡寒气.
Dwight: Well, we can drape every walls, windows, keep out cold.

224
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:17,000
迈克:好吧,我们到哪找帘子呢?
Mike: Alright, where can we get drapes around here.

225
00:15:20,460 --> 00:15:22,640
开萝尔:是的,他也会做帘子.
Carol: Yes, he does drapes too.

226
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:29,480
克莉丝:我感觉自己像是果汁软糖人.
Chrissy: I feel like the Stay Puff Marshmallow Man.

227
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:32,680
为什么不能打开暖气呢?
Why can't we put the heater on?

228
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:35,660
本:你在抱怨什么?你现在暖和了,不是吗?
Ben: What are you complaining about?Your warm now, aren't you?

229
00:15:35,660 --> 00:15:35,760
克莉丝:是的.
Chrissy: Yes.

230
00:15:35,760 --> 00:15:35,860
本:很好.
Ben: Good.

231
00:15:35,860 --> 00:15:35,960
克莉丝:本?
Chrissy: Ben?

232
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:36,060
本:什么!?!?
Ben: What!?!?

233
00:15:37,820 --> 00:15:39,080
克莉丝:我要上厕所.
Chrissy: I have to go to the bathroom.

234
00:15:40,940 --> 00:15:43,720
本:什么?你怎么不早说?
Ben: What?Why didn't you say that six layers ago?

235
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:43,820
克莉丝:因为那时我不想去.
Chrissy: Cause I didn't have to go then.

236
00:15:46,780 --> 00:15:49,180
本:那太不幸了,你只能忍着点了.
Ben: Well too bad, you're just going to have to hold it.

237
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:51,380
克莉丝:厕所也用电吗?
Chrissy: Is the bathroom electric too?

238
00:15:51,380 --> 00:15:51,480
本:是的!
Ben: Yes!

239
00:15:53,100 --> 00:15:54,840
克莉丝:都是你的错,
Chrissy: This is all your fault Ben Seaver!

240
00:15:55,160 --> 00:15:57,860
本.你弄坏了灯,
You broke the lights, now you broke the bathroom;

241
00:15:58,060 --> 00:15:59,880
现在又弄坏了厕所;我打赌是你搞坏了整个街区.
I bet you broke the whole neighborhood.

242
00:16:01,580 --> 00:16:02,520
本:是啊,克莉丝!
Ben: That's right Chrissy!

243
00:16:02,700 --> 00:16:06,000
一切都是我弄坏的,这些都是我邪恶计划的一部分.
I broke everything, its all part of my sick twisted plan.

244
00:16:06,460 --> 00:16:09,900
你猜怎么样,好戏还在后头呢.我会死掉,外面在结冰,最小的会先死.
Guess what, I saved the best for last.We are going to die, it's freezing outside and the smallest goes first.

245
00:16:09,900 --> 00:16:15,300
克莉丝:(哭)
Chrissy: (cries)

246
00:16:15,300 --> 00:16:21,400
本:噢…好了,克莉丝.我开玩笑的.一切都会好的.
Ben: Aw...come on Chrissy, I'm just kidding.Everything is going to be fine.

247
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:29,720
克莉丝:不是的.你说的,最小的先死,我就是最小的.
Chrissy: It is not.You said the smallest goes first, and I'm the smallest.

248
00:16:30,580 --> 00:16:35,560
本:看,克莉丝,别哭了.好吧,你想看我做鬼脸吗?
Ben: Look Chrissy don't cry.Ok, you want me to make a "googy" face?

249
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:37,380
克莉丝:你本来就是鬼脸.
Chrissy: You always have a "googy" face.

250
00:16:37,380 --> 00:16:38,000
本:好吧,我给你讲个故事?三只小猪的故事怎么样?
Ben: Ok, I'll tell you a story?How about the Three Little Pigs?

251
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:40,500
克莉丝:故事里还有只狼.
Chrissy: There is a wolf in that one.

252
00:16:40,500 --> 00:16:41,800
本:那么…小红帽怎么样?
Ben: Umm...how about Little Red Riding Hood?

253
00:16:41,800 --> 00:16:44,200
克莉丝:那里面也有只狼.
Chrissy: There is a wolf in that one too.

254
00:16:44,200 --> 00:16:45,100
本:面包师呢?
Ben: Ginger Bread Man?

255
00:16:45,100 --> 00:16:47,900
克莉丝:有狼.
Chrissy: Wolf.

256
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:54,240
本:克莉丝,我做什么事能让你感觉好点吗?
Ben: Chrissy, isn't there anything I can do to make you feel better?

257
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:55,980
克莉丝:你带我上厕所.
Chrissy: You can take me to the bathroom.

258
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:02,500
本:说对了.这边走.
Ben: You got it.Walk this way.

259
00:17:08,100 --> 00:17:09,280
抱紧我,宝贝;我会好好照顾你的.
Stick with me cutie-pie; I'll take good care of you.

260
00:17:11,820 --> 00:17:18,220
杰森:五个小时困在车里,一个浪漫的夜晚.啊?
Jason: Five hours stuck in a car that is some romantic evening.What?

261
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:21,960
麦琪:你在说我们的初次约会?
Maggie: You just described our first date.

262
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:22,060
杰森:噢.
Jason: Oh.

263
00:17:22,060 --> 00:17:22,100
麦琪:什么?
Maggie: What?

264
00:17:25,700 --> 00:17:29,120
杰森:是的,我记得当时为和你单独出去,
Jason: Yeah, I remember how hard I had to work to get you alone on that

265
00:17:29,120 --> 00:17:30,080
我拼命工作赚钱买了第一辆车.
first car of mine.

266
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:32,360
麦琪:我还记得当时你说的话."嘿,
Maggie: Well I still remember what you said."

267
00:17:32,980 --> 00:17:33,600
马隆,想不想看我的激情飞车?"
Hey Malone, want to see my fuzzy dice?"

268
00:17:37,040 --> 00:17:42,140
杰森:别笑,它当时有用.我对刚才的事很抱歉.
Jason: Don't laugh, it worked.I'm sorry about earlier.

269
00:17:43,780 --> 00:17:50,940
麦琪:我也是.今晚我都错过了什么?
Maggie: Yeah, me too.So what kind of evening did I miss?

270
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:55,640
杰森:西贡小姐的前排座位,
Jason: Front row seats at Miss Saigon, a window table at the rainbow room,

271
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:58,100
彩虹餐厅靠窗的桌子,还有你非常喜欢的带花帽子的马,骑着它穿过中央公园.
and a buggy ride through central park with what horse in the little flowered hat that you love so much.

